---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import { site, localBusinessSchema } from '../../config/site';

const procedureSchema = {
  "@context": "https://schema.org",
  "@type": "MedicalProcedure",
  "name": "Ridge Augmentation in Houston TX",
  "description": "Restore the natural contour of your gums and jaw. Essential preparation for successful dental implants.",
  "procedureType": "https://schema.org/Therapeutic",
  "provider": {
    "@type": "Dentist",
    "name": "Dentiq Dentistry",
    "address": {
      "@type": "PostalAddress",
      "addressLocality": "Houston"
    }
  }
};
---

<BaseLayout
  title={`Ridge Augmentation Houston | ${site.name}`}
  description="Restore the natural contour of your gums and jaw. Essential preparation for successful dental implants."
  schema={[localBusinessSchema, procedureSchema]}
>
  <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-16 md:py-24">
    <p class="text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-widest text-brand-primary mb-4">
      <a href="/services" class="hover:underline">Services</a>
    </p>
    <h1 class="font-serif text-4xl md:text-5xl font-bold text-neutral-dark mb-4 leading-tight">
      Ridge Augmentation in Houston TX
    </h1>
    <p class="text-xl text-neutral-mid mb-8 leading-relaxed">
      Restore the natural contour of your gums and jaw. Essential preparation for successful dental implants.
    </p>
    <div class="prose prose-lg max-w-none text-neutral-mid leading-relaxed">
      <p class="mb-4">After a tooth is removed, the bone that used to support it can start to shrink as the area heals. That change can flatten the gumline, affect how your smile looks, and make it harder to replace the tooth later. Ridge augmentation rebuilds that lost contour in the gums and jaw — restoring the natural shape of the ridge and strengthening the area so it can support a future restoration. This is especially important when planning for a dental implant.</p>
      
    </div>
    <div class="mt-10 flex gap-4 flex-wrap">
      <a href="/schedule" class="btn-primary">Schedule a Consultation</a>
      <a href="/services" class="btn-secondary">View All Services</a>
    </div>
  </div>

  <section class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 pb-16 md:pb-24">
    <div class="prose prose-lg max-w-none text-neutral-mid leading-relaxed space-y-4">
      <p>Ridge augmentation is a dental procedure that is typically done after a tooth extraction</p>
      <p>This procedure recreates the natural contour of the gums or jaw that was lost during the extraction</p>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
